(7676078, 1254936, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous! Such a great model and clothing/setup!  Wow!<br/> <br/>The 2020 version of this in the challenge nailed the rectangular composition of the original one, so that will give you a fight for placement, but I really love this!<br/> <br/>I can''t wait to see how they both finish.</td>', 'This is fabulous! Such a great model and clothing/setup!  Wow! The 2020 version of this in the challenge nailed the rectangular composition of the original one, so that will give you a fight for placement, but I really love this! I can''t wait to see how they both finish.', '2020-10-07 12:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676079, 1255020, 86447, '<td valign="top">You''ve gotten the composition perfect... just like the original!   Love the Pandemic humor!<br/> <br/> <br/>The other Whistler''s mom in the gallery here has a bit of clarity over yours, I think, but I really like both.<br/> <br/>I can''t wait to see how they both finish.</td>', 'You''ve gotten the composition perfect... just like the original!   Love the Pandemic humor!  The other Whistler''s mom in the gallery here has a bit of clarity over yours, I think, but I really like both. I can''t wait to see how they both finish.', '2020-10-07 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
