(7676141, 1254929, 24983, '<td valign="top">We Had A Forger of NZ Art called Carl Sims who did very well with his copies         of Original NZ. Art Mainly Portraits of Maori chieftains, untill he was caught,Carl Sims. he work which was treated as original. He lived up the road in a little town called Foxton, they made Him a Hero for putting the town on the map !!!!!!!!!</td>', 'We Had A Forger of NZ Art called Carl Sims who did very well with his copies         of Original NZ. Art Mainly Portraits of Maori chieftains, untill he was caught,Carl Sims. he work which was treated as original. He lived up the road in a little town called Foxton, they made Him a Hero for putting the town on the map !!!!!!!!!', '2020-10-07 19:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
