(7676346, 1254916, 30049, '<td valign="top">Correct title, but the scene and feel is nothing like Salvador Dali''s painting.  In Dali''s the woman is peering out at the water and the viewer gets a sense of yearning for freedom or waiting on her mate to come home.  This woman''s pose is nothing like the depicted painting.</td>', 'Correct title, but the scene and feel is nothing like Salvador Dali''s painting.  In Dali''s the woman is peering out at the water and the viewer gets a sense of yearning for freedom or waiting on her mate to come home.  This woman''s pose is nothing like the depicted painting.', '2020-10-09 22:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
