(7676598, 1254733, 50695, '<td valign="top">this title really took me on a journey. I think the painting you''re referring to is actually a rip off of Georgia O''Keeffe by Harold Davis:<br/> <br/>https://www.turningart.com/art/kiss-from-a-rose-by-harold-davis<br/> <br/>It lacks the immediacy and vulnerability of O''Keeffe.<br/> <br/>One clue that it''s a rip-off is the title. Georgia O''Keeffe didn''t name any paintings after Seal songs.</td>', 'this title really took me on a journey. I think the painting you''re referring to is actually a rip off of Georgia O''Keeffe by Harold Davis: https://www.turningart.com/art/kiss-from-a-rose-by-harold-davis It lacks the immediacy and vulnerability of O''Keeffe. One clue that it''s a rip-off is the title. Georgia O''Keeffe didn''t name any paintings after Seal songs.', '2020-10-12 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
