(7676656, 1254929, 138630, '<td valign="top">I wish I hadn''t seen this so often here . . . but every time I do, I love it so I give it one of my top scores.  Understated, elegant, perfectly done.  10</td>', 'I wish I hadn''t seen this so often here . . . but every time I do, I love it so I give it one of my top scores.  Understated, elegant, perfectly done.  10', '2020-10-13 11:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676657, 1255020, 138630, '<td valign="top">The mask, the cellphone, the sampler on the wall - such nice touches.  I am bothered by the slight glow around her, most obvious, unfortunately, around her face and esp. eyes.  But otherwise I like this a lot and find it perfectly in keeping with the challenge both in terms of subject and of editing.  10</td>', 'The mask, the cellphone, the sampler on the wall - such nice touches.  I am bothered by the slight glow around her, most obvious, unfortunately, around her face and esp. eyes.  But otherwise I like this a lot and find it perfectly in keeping with the challenge both in terms of subject and of editing.  10', '2020-10-13 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676658, 1255017, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Maybe his right hand could have been a bit more awkwardly positioned, but otherwise great attention to detail in the pose. And I love the bit of bare shoulder - had to go back to look and see why that :)  IMO there were quite a number of excellent entries, but for my 10''s I decided to go with those that looked as if they were done without the use of "painterly" software, and this fit the bill.</td>', 'Love it.  Maybe his right hand could have been a bit more awkwardly positioned, but otherwise great attention to detail in the pose. And I love the bit of bare shoulder - had to go back to look and see why that :)  IMO there were quite a number of excellent entries, but for my 10''s I decided to go with those that looked as if they were done without the use of "painterly" software, and this fit the bill.', '2020-10-13 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676659, 1254664, 138630, '<td valign="top">Marvelous capture and I love the background tones that increase the look of an old print.  10 from me.</td>', 'Marvelous capture and I love the background tones that increase the look of an old print.  10 from me.', '2020-10-13 11:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
